*.o
*.swp
*.bak

# Build products. These four were committed in the first LabSCim import and carried ever
# since, so every rebuild showed up as a diff of an ELF nobody can read or review, and a
# clone brought someone else's binary that would run in preference to the sources next to
# it. Build them with make; the top-level Makefile drives all four.
/lora_pkt_fwd/lora_pkt_fwd
/util_ack/util_ack
/util_sink/util_sink
/util_tx_test/util_tx_test
